ς</char> <char style="w" x-id="SBLGNT.HEB.8.1.016" x-align="HEB.8.1.a017" x-target-ids="t032" x-target="Majesty" x-target-head="t032" x-head="true" lemma="μεγαλωσύνη" strong="G3172" x-morph="N-GSF" x-gloss="Majesty" x-translit="megalōsynēs" xml:lang="grc">μεγαλωσύνης</char> <char style="w" x-id="SBLGNT.HEB.8.1.017" x-align="HEB.8.1.a018" x-target-ids="t033" x-target="in" x-target-head="t033" x-head="true" lemma="ἐν" strong="G1722" x-morph="PREP" x-gloss="in" x-translit="en" xml:lang="grc">ἐν</char> <char style="w" x-id="SBLGNT.HEB.8.1.018" x-align="HEB.8.1.a019" x-target-ids="t034" x-target="the" x-target-head="t034" x-head="true" lemma="ὁ" strong="G3588" x-morph="T-DPM" x-gloss="the" x-translit="tois" xml:lang="grc">τοῖς</char> <char style="w" x-id="SBLGNT.HEB.8.1.019" x-align="HEB.8.1.a020" x-target-ids="t035" x-target="heavens" x-target-head="t035" x-head="true" lemma="οὐρανός" strong="G3772" x-morph="N-DPM" x-gloss="heavens" x-translit="ouranois" xml:lang="grc">οὐρανοῖς</char>,<verse eid="HEB 8:1" /></para>
